  "description": "An async-first fork of Html Agility Pack: an HTML parser that builds a read/write DOM and supports XPath and XSLT, tolerating real-world malformed HTML. Built for server workloads: no blocking I/O, CancellationToken support throughout, and bring-your-own HttpClient for use with IHttpClientFactory. The API has nullable annotations. Not affiliated with ZZZ Projects.",
